Z||000000||Eric||03-02-2001||10:36 PM||||? about the SE.  It has a single out flowmaster muffler, right?  What is the series # on it.  I thought I remember it being a 40 series non delta flow, but now I'm not sure.  Could one or the other of you clarify this.<P>I just saw and heard a Ferrari 348.  I know my car can't rev like that (the chick driving it must have been wrapping it up to 8 grand; it screamed).  I want the same basic thing to happen.  In other words, when I driving around the car should be relatively quiet and well behaved, but when I step into it, I want the gates of Hell to open up and spew fire, loud music, and the thunderous sounds of the mighty 3.1.  The SE also has this special quality I've been told.  Any info appriciated.||||reg||5
