Z||000002||FieroJoe||03-04-2001||06:52 PM||||I was just about to post a topic about the Flowmaster muffler I found in Summit...<P>Description in catalog is:<P>"40 series Two-Chamber Flowmasters"<BR>Mufflers are 19" overall length, 9.75" wide, 4" thick.<P>[there are a variety of different diameters and offsets, but I think this one is the one needed for single inlet/outlet]<P>FLO-42541 2.5" offset inlet/center outlet  $59.95<P>This muffler is a non-delta flow, the delta flow ones are availble in the same sizes/configs for about $73<P>I dont know if the inlet or outlet is offset, but I know one of them is, and it is 2.5" diameter pipe, right?<P>I want to put a flowmaster that will "behave" as Eric described in my coupe, but only want 1 outlet because I dont want to cut my fascia or swap an 88 coupe/forumla fascia into it.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||1FST2M6||03-05-2001||10:26 AM||||sorry man!! i've been out of touch for a while.. OK. 40 series 2.5 in single/ out. the single in.out makes the best HP/TQ numbers on the dyno.. for the Ferrari sound just Add a 2.5xtwinw 2.25" ansa Glass pack tips. or a Brullen Muffler <A HREF="http://www.brullenexhaust.com" TARGET=_blank>www.brullenexhaust.com</A>  they are about $40-50 more than a flowmaster but are also quieter.  LOL special qualitys.. well.. it's posessed by the devil himself! the exhaust, MSD 6al, Accel Coil, MSD ignition control module, NGK -UR5- plugs, K&N, race clutch, RC injectors, custom chip and a host of other goodies.. and hours of dyno tuning. we still don't really know why this car is so much faster than the other Fieros both myself and GT-B, have run. I'll e-mail you my car on the dyno... and see if that sound is similar to what your looking for...<P>OH you can also look at <A HREF="http://www.powertone.com" TARGET=_blank>www.powertone.com</A>  but try and stay with 2.5" single in and out... the crossflow mufflers have more back pressure and cause the HP and TQ to drop.. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">  <P><BR>ok.. do you have an e-mail addy i can send a file to? don't think Yahoo.. will accept files... <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-05-2001).]||||reg||1
